# Expo template design system

Match the **default Expo Router starter** look and feel in this repo. Reuse existing primitives; do not introduce a parallel design language.

## Theme & colors

- Import tokens from `@/constants/theme`: `Colors`, `Spacing`, `Fonts`, `MaxContentWidth`, `BottomTabInset`.
- Read colors via `useTheme()` or `ThemedView` / `ThemedText` — **no ad-hoc hex** except template accents already in the codebase:
  - Expo blue gradient: `#3C9FFE` → `#0274DF` (icon background, splash)
  - Splash overlay: `#208AEF`
  - Link / primary accent: `#3c87f7` (`ThemedText` type `linkPrimary`)
- Surfaces: `background` (screen) → `backgroundElement` (cards, grouped sections) → `backgroundSelected` (subtle emphasis, input borders).

## Typography

- Use **`ThemedText`** with template types: `title`, `subtitle`, `default`, `small`, `smallBold`, `code`, `link`, `linkPrimary`.
- Section labels: uppercase **`type="code"`** (see home “get started” pattern).
- Web fonts come from `src/global.css` (`--font-display`, `--font-mono`, etc.); native uses `Fonts` from theme (`system-ui`, `ui-monospace`, …).

## Layout

- 4pt grid via **`Spacing`** (`two` = 8, `three` = 16, `four` = 24).
- Centered column: `maxWidth: MaxContentWidth`, horizontal padding `Spacing.four`.
- Group related content in **`ThemedView type="backgroundElement"`** with `borderRadius: Spacing.four`, inner padding `Spacing.three` / `Spacing.four`, `gap: Spacing.three`.

## Motion (Reanimated keyframes)

Follow **`@/components/animated-icon`** — do not replace with generic spring press scales unless the template already uses them.

- **`Keyframe`** + **`entering`** on `Animated.View` from `react-native-reanimated`.
- **Easing:** `Easing.elastic(0.7)` or `Easing.elastic(1.2)` on web hero; splash exit uses elastic fade (~600ms).
- **Splash:** `AnimatedSplashOverlay` coordinates with `expo-splash-screen` (`preventAutoHideAsync` in root layout, hide then animate out).
- **Hero icon:** scale-from-screen keyframe, logo fade-in, slow rotating glow (`logo-glow.png`).

## Components

- **`ThemedView`** / **`ThemedText`** for all UI chrome and copy.
- **`expo-image`** for branded imagery (logos, glow).
- **`SafeAreaView`** for screen insets; tab screens add `BottomTabInset` to bottom padding when using native tabs.
- Prefer template patterns (`HintRow`, `Collapsible`, `ExternalLink`) when building docs-style sections.

## New screens (e.g. auth)

- Hero: optional **`AnimatedIcon`** + **`type="title"`** headline.
- Forms: fields inside a **`backgroundElement`** card; inputs on `background` with `backgroundSelected` hairline border; CTA uses template blue `#3c87f7`.
- Links: **`type="linkPrimary"`**, not custom underline styles.

When extending the design system, add tokens to `src/constants/theme.ts` or `global.css` — keep one source of truth.
